cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "puuwaawaa-normalization: simulation code for 'When scaling changes conservation priorities'"
version: 2.0.0
abstract: >-
  Simulation code and results testing when rescaling a conservation criterion
  changes the portfolio chosen by a budgeted site-action integer program.
  Compares equal-swing and abundance-weighted conservation specifications in
  simulated landscapes of 12, 22 and 50 sites, with diagnostics for
  criterion-wide rescaling, nominal-weight rescaling, whole-matrix and
  column-wise vector normalization, and two effectiveness designs.
type: software
